        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1929230/extras/d47ffe203dc2fb5e3005b9b13a68c290.poster.avif?t=1787305207\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1929230/extras/d47ffe203dc2fb5e3005b9b13a68c290.webm?t=1787305207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The early 2000s. After the collapse of the USSR, no unified state rose in its place. Scattered groups survive in the ruins of the former republics — each with their own order, codes, and morality. A global resource shortage has turned these lands into a magnet for marauders from across the world. Power belongs only to those who can hold it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost Lives is a 2D side-scrolling shooter where you explore procedurally generated locations, fight AI and other players, collect loot and develop your character. The game features multiple modes set in post-Soviet locations, different enemy factions, a variety of weapons, and dynamic weather.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five game modes.</strong> Co-op against bots for 1–4 players, Deathmatch PvP, Gun Game, Team Deathmatch, and Endless waves of enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural generation.</strong> Location layouts, loot placement, AI behavior, and time of day vary between sessions on select maps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NATO and Warsaw Pact weaponry.</strong> Different recoil, accuracy, and handling characteristics. Armor-piercing rounds, grenades, and modifications.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Looting.</strong> Find items from the Soviet and post-Soviet era to sell or trade for better gear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gear.</strong> Body armor, helmets, and backpacks of various classes. Armor level and ammunition type determine the outcome of a fight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced AI.</strong> Bots act situationally: they advance, retreat, take cover, surrender, heal, use grenades, and operate in groups.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Factions.</strong> Several groups with their own interests and backstories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daily tasks.</strong> Objectives refresh every day, with rewards contributing to overall progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards.</strong> Separate PvE and PvP rankings with seasons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weather and time of day.</strong> Dynamic conditions: day-night cycle, rain, fog.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character customization.</strong> Clothing and cosmetic items unlock as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voice chat.</strong> Proximity chat for talking to nearby players, plus a radio mode for team communication.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No aggressive monetization.</strong> No loot boxes, no battle passes, no gear for real money.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1929230/extras/a68b1bedd8c02aeb76918b59fc3fd08d.poster.avif?t=1787305207\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1929230/extras/a68b1bedd8c02aeb76918b59fc3fd08d.webm?t=1787305207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1929230/extras/a68b1bedd8c02aeb76918b59fc3fd08d.mp4?t=1787305207\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1929230/extras/d47ffe203dc2fb5e3005b9b13a68c290.poster.avif?t=1787305207\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1929230/extras/d47ffe203dc2fb5e3005b9b13a68c290.webm?t=1787305207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The early 2000s. After the collapse of the USSR, no unified state rose in its place. Scattered groups survive in the ruins of the former republics — each with their own order, codes, and morality. A global resource shortage has turned these lands into a magnet for marauders from across the world. Power belongs only to those who can hold it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost Lives is a 2D side-scrolling shooter where you explore procedurally generated locations, fight AI and other players, collect loot and develop your character. The game features multiple modes set in post-Soviet locations, different enemy factions, a variety of weapons, and dynamic weather.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five game modes.</strong> Co-op against bots for 1–4 players, Deathmatch PvP, Gun Game, Team Deathmatch, and Endless waves of enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural generation.</strong> Location layouts, loot placement, AI behavior, and time of day vary between sessions on select maps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NATO and Warsaw Pact weaponry.</strong> Different recoil, accuracy, and handling characteristics. Armor-piercing rounds, grenades, and modifications.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Looting.</strong> Find items from the Soviet and post-Soviet era to sell or trade for better gear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gear.</strong> Body armor, helmets, and backpacks of various classes. Armor level and ammunition type determine the outcome of a fight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced AI.</strong> Bots act situationally: they advance, retreat, take cover, surrender, heal, use grenades, and operate in groups.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Factions.</strong> Several groups with their own interests and backstories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daily tasks.</strong> Objectives refresh every day, with rewards contributing to overall progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards.</strong> Separate PvE and PvP rankings with seasons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weather and time of day.</strong> Dynamic conditions: day-night cycle, rain, fog.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character customization.</strong> Clothing and cosmetic items unlock as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voice chat.</strong> Proximity chat for talking to nearby players, plus a radio mode for team communication.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No aggressive monetization.</strong> No loot boxes, no battle passes, no gear for real money.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1929230/extras/a68b1bedd8c02aeb76918b59fc3fd08d.poster.avif?t=1787305207\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1929230/extras/a68b1bedd8c02aeb76918b59fc3fd08d.webm?t=1787305207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1929230/extras/a68b1bedd8c02aeb76918b59fc3fd08d.mp4?t=1787305207\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "short_description": "Lost Lives is a multiplayer 2D shooter with RPG elements set in the post-Soviet wasteland. Fight players in PvP or stand against hostile factions in co-op and endless survival. Hunt for loot, sell it for profit, and build a loadout that fits your playstyle. The right gear means life or death.",
